{"id": "8ca49881-6f93-47c0-a726-ed1de0ccb648", "slug": "aura-next-generation-computing-1", "title": "Aura - Next Generation Computing", "description": "Aura Next Pricing Section is designed for comparing plans and supporting conversion decisions. Key features include plan comparison blocks and conversion-oriented actions. It is suitable for subscription pricing pages and plan comparison experiences.", "content": "---\nversion: \"neuform-staff-featured-2026-05-22\"\nname: \"Aura - Next Generation Computing\"\ndescription: \"Aura Next Pricing Section is designed for comparing plans and supporting conversion decisions. Key features include plan comparison blocks and conversion-oriented actions. It is suitable for subscription pricing pages and plan comparison experiences.\"\ncolors:\n  primary: \"#FF55FF\"\n  secondary: \"#F2EEE7\"\n  accent: \"#55FF00\"\n  background: \"#F2EEE7\"\n  surface: \"#FFFFFF\"\n  text-primary: \"#111827\"\n  text-secondary: \"#4B5563\"\n  border: \"#E5E7EB\"\ntypography:\n  display-lg:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter\"\n    fontSize: \"64px\"\n    fontWeight: 500\n    lineHeight: \"1.04\"\n    letterSpacing: \"0\"\n  body-md:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter\"\n    fontSize: \"16px\"\n    fontWeight: 400\n    lineHeight: \"1.6\"\n  label-md:\n    fontFamily: \"JetBrains Mono\"\n    fontSize: \"12px\"\n    fontWeight: 600\n    lineHeight: \"1.2\"\nspacing:\n  base: \"8px\"\n  gap: \"16px\"\n  card-padding: \"24px\"\n  section-padding: \"80px\"\nrounded:\n  card: \"8px\"\n  control: \"8px\"\n  pill: \"9999px\"\ncomponents:\n  card:\n    background: \"Use the surface token with subtle borders and HTML-matched shadow depth\"\n    radius: \"Match the declared card radius token\"\n  button:\n    background: \"Use primary or accent colors for the main action\"\n    radius: \"Use the control or pill radius based on the source HTML\"\n---\n# Aura - Next Generation Computing\nSource: Neuform staff featured templates. Author: Sourasith Phomhome (@madebysourasith). Views: 84; favorites: 4; remixes: 1.\nTags: pricing, section, animated, cta, billing.\n## Overview\nAura Next Pricing Section is designed for comparing plans and supporting conversion decisions. Key features include plan comparison blocks and conversion-oriented actions. It is suitable for subscription pricing pages and plan comparison experiences.\n\nAura Platform Solutions Documentation Pricing Log in Get Started Aura Engine v2.0 is now live Compute at the edge of possibility. Deploy globally in milliseconds. Aura provides the infrastructure to build, scale, and se…\n## Composition\nUse the attached HTML reference as the source of truth. Preserve the visible hierarchy, first-screen composition, section rhythm, density, and interaction tone before adapting copy or content.\nKey visible headings include: Compute at the edge of possibility..\n## Colors\nAnchor the palette in primary #FF55FF, secondary #F2EEE7, accent #55FF00, background #F2EEE7, surface #FFFFFF, text-primary #111827. Keep background, surface, text, and border roles distinct so generated layouts retain the same contrast pattern as the source.\n## Typography\nUse Inter for display moments and Inter for body copy unless the HTML clearly demands a compatible fallback. Labels and technical metadata should use JetBrains Mono or an equivalent mono face.\n## Layout\nKeep spacing deliberate and stable. Favor the same grid direction, max-width behavior, card density, and responsive stacking seen in the HTML. Do not replace distinctive source structures with generic SaaS sections.\n## Components\nAuthentication and CTA controls should preserve the source button hierarchy, input density, and focused conversion path.\n## Motion\nPreserve existing motion cues such as masked reveals, staggered entrance, hover lift, scroll-triggered transitions, and ambient movement. Keep easing smooth and restrained.\n## WebGL & Effects\n\nIf the source includes canvas, WebGL, Three.js, gradients, particles, or atmospheric effects, rebuild them as supporting layers behind the content. Keep effects performant, responsive, and secondary to the interface.\n\n## Guardrails\n- Do not flatten the source into a generic card grid.\n- Do not swap the color mode unless the source clearly supports it.\n- Preserve the first viewport signal, focal object, and visual density.\n- Keep buttons, cards, and badges aligned to the same radius and border language.", "preview_html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>Aura - Next Generation Computing</title>\n    <script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://code.iconify.design/iconify-icon/1.0.7/iconify-icon.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/matter-js/0.19.0/matter.min.js\"></script>\n</head>\n<body class=\"bg-[#f2eee7] text-slate-900 font-sans antialiased selection:bg-[#ff55ff]/30 selection:text-slate-900 flex flex-col min-h-screen\">\n\n    <!-- Navigation -->\n    <nav class=\"fixed top-0 left-0 right-0 z-50 bg-[#f2eee7]/80 backdrop-blur-md border-b border-black/5\">\n        <div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-6 h-16 flex items-center justify-between\">\n            <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n                <div class=\"relative w-5 h-5\">\n                    <div class=\"absolute inset-0 border-2 border-slate-900\"></div>\n                    <div class=\"absolute top-1.5 left-1.5 w-full h-full bg-slate-900\"></div>\n                </div>\n                <span class=\"text-lg font-semibold tracking-tight ml-2\">Aura</span>\n            </div>\n            \n            <div class=\"hidden md:flex items-center gap-8\">\n                <a href=\"#\" class=\"text-sm font-medium text-slate-600 hover:text-slate-900 transition-colors\">Platform</a>\n                <a href=\"#\" class=\"text-sm font-medium text-slate-600 hover:text-slate-900 transition-colors\">Solutions</a>\n                <a href=\"#\" class=\"text-sm font-medium text-slate-600 hover:text-slate-900 transition-colors\">Documentation</a>\n                <a href=\"#\" class=\"text-sm font-medium text-slate-600 hover:text-slate-900 transition-colors\">Pricing</a>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"flex items-center gap-4\">\n                <a href=\"#\" class=\"hidden md:block text-sm font-medium text-slate-600 hover:text-slate-900 transition-colors\">Log in</a>\n                <a href=\"#\" class=\"h-9 px-4 inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-slate-900 text-white text-sm font-medium hover:bg-slate-800 transition-colors\">\n                    Get Started\n                </a>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </nav>\n\n    <!-- Main Content -->\n    <main class=\"flex-grow pt-32 pb-24 px-6\">\n        <div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto\">\n            \n            <!-- Hero Text -->\n            <div class=\"flex flex-col items-center text-center mb-16\">\n                <div class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full border border-slate-300 bg-white/50 text-xs font-medium text-slate-700 mb-8\">\n                    <span class=\"flex h-2 w-2 rounded-full bg-[#55ff00]\"></span>\n                    Aura Engine v2.0 is now live\n                </div>\n                \n                <h1 class=\"text-5xl md:text-7xl font-semibold tracking-tight max-w-4xl mb-6\">\n                    Compute at the edge of <br class=\"hidden md:block\" /> possibility.\n                </h1>\n                \n                <p class=\"text-lg text-slate-600 max-w-2xl mb-10 leading-relaxed\">\n                    Deploy globally in milliseconds. Aura provides the infrastructure to build, scale, and secure applications with unparalleled performance.\n                </p>\n                \n                <div class=\"flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center gap-4\">\n                    <a href=\"#\" class=\"h-11 px-6 inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-slate-900 text-white text-sm font-medium hover:bg-slate-800 transition-all shadow-sm\">\n                        Start building for free\n                    </a>\n                    <a href=\"#\" class=\"h-11 px-6 inline-flex items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-white text-slate-900 border border-slate-200 text-sm font-medium hover:bg-slate-50 transition-all\">\n                        <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:book-linear\" class=\"mr-2 text-lg\"></iconify-icon>\n                        Read the docs\n                    </a>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Animated Canvas Graphic Area -->\n            <div class=\"w-full max-w-5xl mx-auto relative aspect-[16/10] md:aspect-[2/1] bg-[#f2eee7] flex items-center justify-center mb-24 cursor-grab active:cursor-grabbing\">\n                <!-- Canvas Container -->\n                <div class=\"absolute inset-0 w-full h-full\" id=\"canvas-container\">\n                    <canvas id=\"hero-canvas\" class=\"w-full h-full block\"></canvas>\n                </div>\n                \n                <!-- Overlay Logo -->\n                <div class=\"relative z-10 flex items-center gap-5 pointer-events-none drop-shadow-2xl\">\n                    <div class=\"relative w-10 h-10 md:w-14 md:h-14\">\n                        <div class=\"absolute top-0 left-0 w-7 h-7 md:w-10 md:h-10 border-[3px] md:border-[4px] border-[#ff55ff]\"></div>\n                        <div class=\"absolute bottom-0 right-0 w-7 h-7 md:w-10 md:h-10 bg-[#ff55ff]\"></div>\n                    </div>\n                    <span class=\"text-white text-5xl md:text-7xl font-semibold tracking-tight\">Aura</span>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Stats/Numbers Section -->\n            <div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8 max-w-4xl mx-auto pt-8 border-t border-slate-200\">\n                <div class=\"flex flex-col items-center text-center\">\n                    <span class=\"text-4xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-slate-900 mb-2\">1.2M+</span>\n                    <span class=\"text-sm font-medium text-slate-500\">Requests per second</span>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"flex flex-col items-center text-center\">\n                    <span class=\"text-4xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-slate-900 mb-2\">99.99%</span>\n                    <span class=\"text-sm font-medium text-slate-500\">Guaranteed uptime SLA</span>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"flex flex-col items-center text-center\">\n                    <span class=\"text-4xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-slate-900 mb-2\">~15ms</span>\n                    <span class=\"text-sm font-medium text-slate-500\">Global average latency</span>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n        </div>\n    </main>\n\n    <script>\n        // Matter.js Setup\n        const { Engine, Render, Runner, World, Bodies, Composite, Mouse, MouseConstraint } = Matter;\n\n        const engine = Engine.create();\n        const world = engine.world;\n        const canvas = document.getElementById('hero-canvas');\n        const container = document.getElementById('canvas-container');\n\n        // Color palette matched to reference\n        const colors = {\n            1: '#ff55ff', // Pink\n            2: '#55ffff', // Cyan\n            3: '#aa55ff', // Purple\n            4: '#55ff00', // Green\n            5: '#ff8800', // Orange\n            6: '#050505'  // Black\n        };\n\n        // Grid map representing the reference layout\n        const gridMap = [\n            [1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 5, 5, 5, 4, 3, 2, 1],\n            [1, 2, 3, 6, 6, 6, 6, 6, 6, 3, 2, 1],\n            [1, 2, 6, 6, 6, 6, 6, 6, 6, 6, 2, 1],\n            [1, 2, 6, 6, 6, 6, 6, 6, 6, 6, 2, 1],\n            [1, 2, 6, 6, 6, 6, 6, 6, 6, 6, 2, 1],\n            [1, 2, 3, 6, 6, 6, 6, 6, 6, 3, 2, 1],\n            [1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 5, 5, 5, 4, 3, 2, 1]\n        ];\n\n        const render = Render.create({\n            canvas: canvas,\n            engine: engine,\n            options: {\n                width: container.clientWidth,\n                height: container.clientHeight,\n                background: 'transparent',\n                wireframes: false,\n                pixelRatio: window.devicePixelRatio || 1\n            }\n        });\n\n        // Add mouse interaction\n        const mouse = Mouse.create(render.canvas);\n        const mouseConstraint = MouseConstraint.create(engine, {\n            mouse: mouse,\n            constraint: {\n                stiffness: 0.1,\n                render: { visible: false }\n            }\n        });\n        render.mouse = mouse;\n\n        let resizeTimer;\n\n        function initScene() {\n            // Reset world\n            World.clear(world, false);\n            Engine.clear(engine);\n            Composite.add(world, mouseConstraint);\n\n            const w = container.clientWidth;\n            const h = container.clientHeight;\n            \n            render.canvas.width = w * (window.devicePixelRatio || 1);\n            render.canvas.height = h * (window.devicePixelRatio || 1);\n            render.options.width = w;\n            render.options.height = h;\n\n            // Bounds/Walls to keep bodies inside\n            const wallOpts = { isStatic: true, render: { visible: false } };\n            const thickness = 100;\n            const walls = [\n                Bodies.rectangle(w/2, h + thickness/2, w, thickness, wallOpts), // ground\n                Bodies.rectangle(w/2, -thickness/2, w, thickness, wallOpts),    // ceiling\n                Bodies.rectangle(-thickness/2, h/2, thickness, h, wallOpts),    // left\n                Bodies.rectangle(w + thickness/2, h/2, thickness, h, wallOpts)  // right\n            ];\n            Composite.add(world, walls);\n\n            // Compute block size identical to the previous canvas layout\n            const cols = gridMap[0].length;\n            const rows = gridMap.length;\n            const padding = w * 0.05;\n            const availableW = w - (padding * 2);\n            const availableH = h - (padding * 2);\n            \n            const blockSize = Math.min(availableW / cols, availableH / rows);\n            const gridWidth = blockSize * cols;\n            const gridHeight = blockSize * rows;\n            const startX = (w - gridWidth) / 2 + (blockSize / 2);\n            const startY = (h - gridHeight) / 2 + (blockSize / 2);\n\n            // Populate the bodies\n            for (let y = 0; y < rows; y++) {\n                for (let x = 0; x < cols; x++) {\n                    const colorIdx = gridMap[y][x];\n                    if (!colorIdx) continue;\n\n                    // Small gap to allow gravity/bounce to look natural right away\n                    const currentSize = colorIdx === 6 ? blockSize * 0.98 : blockSize * 0.88;\n                    \n                    const box = Bodies.rectangle(\n                        startX + (x * blockSize), \n                        startY + (y * blockSize), \n                        currentSize, \n                        currentSize, \n                        {\n                            render: {\n                                fillStyle: colors[colorIdx],\n                                strokeStyle: 'transparent',\n                                lineWidth: 0\n                            },\n                            chamfer: { radius: 2 },\n                            restitution: 0.6,\n                            friction: 0.1,\n                            density: colorIdx === 6 ? 0.005 : 0.001 // Make black core blocks heavier\n                        }\n                    );\n                    Composite.add(world, box);\n                }\n            }\n        }\n\n        // Initialize and run Matter.js\n        initScene();\n        Render.run(render);\n        const runner = Runner.create();\n        Runner.run(runner, engine);\n\n        // Handle responsive resizing\n        window.addEventListener('resize', () => {\n            clearTimeout(resizeTimer);\n            resizeTimer = setTimeout(initScene, 200);\n        });\n    </script>\n</body>\n</html>", "preview_file_name": "aura-next-generation-computing-1.html", "thumbnail_url": "https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/design-system-thumbnails/staff-featured-2026-05-22/aura-next-generation-computing-1.jpg", "source_name": "aura-next-generation-computing-1-DESIGN.md", "views": 118, "forks": 1, "private": false, "featured": true, "created_by": "5bd6211c-bd4c-467c-b442-4312cac4712c", "created_at": "2026-06-12T07:38:10.793894+00:00", "updated_at": "2026-07-03T11:24:52.229007+00:00"}